{
  "id": "get-started-see-dashboards",
  "title": "See a dashboard",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "**What you will learn:** A dashboard is a saved page of panels. You'll open one of Play's example dashboards and find the two controls every dashboard shares."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "To open a dashboard, complete the following steps:"
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "open-a-dashboard",
      "title": "Open a dashboard",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "a[data-testid='data-testid Nav menu item'][href='/dashboards']",
          "content": "Click **Dashboards** in the main menu. This page lists every saved dashboard, grouped in folders.",
          "requirements": ["navmenu-open", "exists-reftarget"]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/d/Zb3f4veGk/stats",
          "verify": "on-page:/d/Zb3f4veGk",
          "objectives": ["on-page:/d/Zb3f4veGk"],
          "content": "Open **Stats**, one of the dashboards in the **Examples** folder."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "You opened a saved dashboard from the dashboard list. No setup, just a click."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Next, find the two parts every dashboard shares:"
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "read-the-dashboard",
      "title": "Read the dashboard",
      "requirements": ["on-page:/d/Zb3f4veGk"],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "doIt": false,
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='data-testid Panel header The Basics']",
          "content": "Each rectangle on this page is a **panel**: one view of the data. This one shows a single number. Others show charts or tables.",
          "tooltip": "One view of the data. A dashboard is a saved page of these.",
          "requirements": ["on-page:/d/Zb3f4veGk", "exists-reftarget"]
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "doIt": false,
          "reftarget": "button[data-testid='data-testid TimePicker Open Button']",
          "content": "The **time range** sets the window of time the page shows. Change it, and every panel follows.",
          "tooltip": "The window of time the whole page is showing. Every panel follows it.",
          "requirements": ["on-page:/d/Zb3f4veGk", "exists-reftarget"]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "**What you have learned:** Panels show the data, and the time range sets the window. That's enough to read almost any dashboard you meet."
    }
  ]
}
